OL,3,AGas bill standing charges to be
OL,4,Ascrapped for millions, chancellor says
OL,5,Aahead of Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FGas bill standing charges are to be
OL,8,Fscrapped for millions of households,
OL,9,Fthe chancellor announces, hours before
OL,10,Fhe delivers his first Budget
OL,12,FThe move by John Healey will save 60%
OL,13,Fof households an average of #45 per
OL,14,Fyear, according to the Treasury
OL,16,FJohn Healey is due to set out the
OL,17,Fgovernment's tax and spending plans
OL,18,Fwhen he unveils the Budget at 12:30 GMT
OL,19,F- here's how the day will unfold
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
