OL,3,AGas bill standing charges to be
OL,4,Ascrapped for millions, chancellor says
OL,5,Aahead of Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has promised a plan that
OL,8,F"moves money and power out of
OL,9,FWestminster", but ministers face
OL,10,Fpressure on the cost of living and
OL,11,Ffunding defence
OL,13,FThis first Budget of Andy Burnham's
OL,14,Fpremiership is due to shield some
OL,15,Fpensioners from income tax and increase
OL,16,Fthe minimum wage - though the BBC
OL,17,Funderstands 18- to 20-year-olds are set
OL,18,Fto see lower increases than in previous
OL,19,Fyears
